    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confection Combat is a PvE sugar-based Shooter. Team up with your friends to fight armies of confection-based bad guys.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Silly Weapons: Choose from a variety of candy-based weapons including the Gummy Bear gun, Smore Launcher, Cane gun, Cane Cannon, Candy Corn Launcher and guided candy corn launcher.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ridiculous enemies: Fight Gingerbread men, chocolate spiders, marshmallows and tanks made of graham crackers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Play online with up to 5 of your friends or play on your Local Area network (LAN). Need practice? Play a single player game and see how high of a score you can get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore 4 different battlefields each with its own unique features and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-NPCs too easy? Try playing Sugar Crash mode where the enemies, annoyed with your presence turn on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-No DLC packs and no paywalls, buy the game once and you have access to everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506560/extras/9817a68bdf9665a0b1bef7b54e4eb833.avif?t=1740146946\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506560/extras/61e79b96771d6220b1430ce2a83713b7.avif?t=1740146946\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confection Combat is a PvE sugar-based Shooter. Team up with your friends to fight armies of confection-based bad guys.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Silly Weapons: Choose from a variety of candy-based weapons including the Gummy Bear gun, Smore Launcher, Cane gun, Cane Cannon, Candy Corn Launcher and guided candy corn launcher.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ridiculous enemies: Fight Gingerbread men, chocolate spiders, marshmallows and tanks made of graham crackers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Play online with up to 5 of your friends or play on your Local Area network (LAN). Need practice? Play a single player game and see how high of a score you can get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore 4 different battlefields each with its own unique features and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-NPCs too easy? Try playing Sugar Crash mode where the enemies, annoyed with your presence turn on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-No DLC packs and no paywalls, buy the game once and you have access to everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506560/extras/9817a68bdf9665a0b1bef7b54e4eb833.avif?t=1740146946\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506560/extras/61e79b96771d6220b1430ce2a83713b7.avif?t=1740146946\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
